<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>Codex models are now discovered from the CLI&#x27;s local model cache, so the model picker shows the correct, current set of Codex models in their intended order — even when Codex is installed via npm (which ships a JavaScript launcher rather than a native binary).</li>
<li>Codex models marked as hidden are now filtered out of the model picker, so you only see models meant to be selectable.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
