        <item>
            <title>0.63</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 11 Jul 2026 19:05:02 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1783821826</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.63</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; }
  ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>New Features</h2>
<ul>
<li>Added a built-in code editor pane. You can now open and edit source files directly inside Addy with line numbers, a gutter, and language-server–backed hover and go-to-definition, without leaving the workspace.</li>
<li>Added a Project Setup pane that scans a project&#x27;s readiness (dependencies, worktrees, environment) and offers one-click setup actions. Setup steps are captured as reusable &quot;recipes&quot; with dependency ordering, and can be run by an agent from an inline prompt.</li>
<li>Added an active repository scope for multi-repo projects. You can pick which repository is &quot;active,&quot; and terminals, Git actions, and agent commands are scoped to that repo.</li>
<li>Added drag-to-reorder for panes — grab a pane&#x27;s chrome and drag it to move or reorder it within the split layout.</li>
<li>Added a &quot;Reopen Closed Pane&quot; command (Cmd-Shift-T) that restores the most recently closed pane.</li>
<li>Added the ability to queue messages while a chat response is still generating, and to edit those queued messages inline before they send.</li>
<li>Added runtime model and reasoning-effort controls to chat. You can switch models and pick a reasoning effort (low through max, where supported) mid-conversation, with options discovered from the installed CLI&#x27;s model catalog.</li>
<li>Added Git change attribution to agent sessions, so changes made during a run are linked back to the agent session that produced them.</li>
<li>Added manual plan approval from the plan card&#x27;s right-click context menu.</li>
<li>The Tasks pane is now available in production builds.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>Redesigned the Tests pane around structured test output, with clearer per-test results, pass/fail parsing, and status reporting.</li>
<li>Redesigned the Git pane with line-level diffs and improved layout.</li>
<li>Linear data now loads by scoped pages for faster, more responsive issue browsing, alongside broader Linear view improvements.</li>
<li>Codex models now expose their metadata and CLI profile options, so Codex-specific settings (like reasoning effort) are handled correctly.</li>
<li>The model picker now hides CLI model profiles that aren&#x27;t actually available and falls back to an available default chat profile when selecting a model.</li>
<li>Deleting a memory now asks for confirmation before removing it.</li>
<li>Notepad now sanitizes pasted text to strip unwanted formatting and control characters.</li>
<li>Refreshed onboarding with a takeover flow and smoother book-shell page transitions.</li>
<li>Numerous layout and polish fixes: centered the Git commit button, corrected server start icon rotation, fixed pane launcher row alignment, added spacing between action button icons and titles, and preserved selected-card styling across hover and theme changes.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Bug Fixes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed terminal rendering corruption, scrollback glitches, and breakage that occurred when an agent CLI exited. Terminal frames are now clamped to a minimum size, and the app survives split-view layout exceptions during pane drags.</li>
<li>Automation/agent input sent to a terminal no longer yanks the view out of scrollback while you&#x27;re reading history.</li>
<li>Stuck terminal state is now only reset after the agent CLI actually exits, avoiding premature resets.</li>
<li>Fixed multi-repo Git pane accordion behavior and layout issues.</li>
<li>Fixed pane resize behavior and now honors the sizing policy for build and terminal panes, keeping owned child panes contained within their parent columns.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Internal Changes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Simplified the built-in browser by removing the Direct/Compatibility mode split and the localhost proxy server (~2,500 lines removed); localhost sites now load directly.</li>
<li>Removed an ineffective localhost CSP/HSTS header rewrite rule list from the browser.</li>
<li>Project recipes and setup data now sync across your devices via CloudKit while keeping local project files protected.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
